<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <title>Your Sidequests invite</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Join your friend on Sidequests. Open your invite in the app or save the code for later." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
    <script src="/sidequests/invite.js" defer is:inline></script>
  </head>
  <body class="sidequests-info-page">
    <header class="site-header shell"><a class="pocket-mark" href="/">POCKET POWERED</a><a class="text-link" href="/sidequests/">Sidequests</a></header>
    <main class="sidequests-info">
      <p class="kicker">Better with a friend</p>
      <h1>Your next adventure starts here.</h1>
      <p class="lede" id="invite-status" role="status">Open this invite on your phone. You can also enter its code in Sidequests after signing in.</p>
      <div id="invite-actions" hidden>
        <p><a class="button button--yellow" id="open-invite">Open Sidequests</a></p>
        <p>Your invite code: <strong id="invite-code"></strong></p>
        <button class="button" id="copy-invite" type="button">Copy invite code</button>
        <p id="copy-status" role="status"></p>
      </div>
      <h2>Need the app?</h2>
      <p>Install Sidequests, sign in, then return to this link or enter your saved code in Friends. You’ll see the invite details before joining.</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="/sidequests/go/ios">Get the iPhone beta</a> <a class="button" href="/sidequests/">Get the Android beta</a></p>
      <p>Invites can expire or be revoked. If yours no longer works, ask your friend for a new link.</p>
      <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to open the invite directly, or copy the code from this link and enter it in Friends in the app.</p></noscript>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer shell"><a href="/sidequests/support/">Support</a><a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy</a></footer>
  </body>
</html>
